{"id":"e1b2071b23104400","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dfa-product.md","title":"DFA 的乘积与布尔接受条件","display":"df-dfa-product — DFA 的乘积与布尔接受条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dfa-product","aliases":["73-df-dfa-product"],"display":"df-dfa-product — DFA 的乘积与布尔接受条件","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§3.2, pp. 59–60; scans 67–68","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dfa-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dfa-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dfa-product — DFA 的乘积与布尔接受条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.2, pp. 59–60; scans 67–68"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定同一字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i=(Q_i,\\Sigma,\\delta_i,q_i,F_i)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M_i=(Q_i,\\Sigma,\\delta_i,q_i,F_i)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1,2\">\\(i=1,2\\)</span>），见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq Q_1\\times Q_2\">\\(B\\subseteq Q_1\\times Q_2\\)</span> 为自由接受集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Q_1,q\\in Q_2,a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(p\\in Q_1,q\\in Q_2,a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\times}((p,q),a)\\coloneqq(\\delta_1(p,a),\\delta_2(q,a)),\\qquad M_1\\otimes_B M_2\\coloneqq(Q_1\\times Q_2,\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\times},(q_1,q_2),B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\times}((p,q),a)\\coloneqq(\\delta_1(p,a),\\delta_2(q,a)),\\qquad M_1\\otimes_B M_2\\coloneqq(Q_1\\times Q_2,\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\times},(q_1,q_2),B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\nB_{\\cap}\\coloneqq F_1\\times F_2,\\quad B_{\\cup}\\coloneqq(F_1\\times Q_2)\\cup(Q_1\\times F_2),\\quad B_{\\triangle}\\coloneqq(F_1\\times(Q_2\\setminus F_2))\\cup((Q_1\\setminus F_1)\\times F_2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\nB_{\\cap}\\coloneqq F_1\\times F_2,\\quad B_{\\cup}\\coloneqq(F_1\\times Q_2)\\cup(Q_1\\times F_2),\\quad B_{\\triangle}\\coloneqq(F_1\\times(Q_2\\setminus F_2))\\cup((Q_1\\setminus F_1)\\times F_2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\nM_1\\otimes_B M_2\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\nM_1\\otimes_B M_2\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有状态分量都来自对应输入机器。接受集是构造的显式参数；同一乘积转移可以分别计算交、并或对称差。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定同一字母表 $\\Sigma$，$M_i=(Q_i,\\Sigma,\\delta_i,q_i,F_i)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$（$i=1,2$），见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]。$B\\subseteq Q_1\\times Q_2$ 为自由接受集，$p\\in Q_1,q\\in Q_2,a\\in\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M_i=(Q_i,\\Sigma,\\delta_i,q_i,F_i)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"i=1,2","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq Q_1\\times Q_2","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Q_1,q\\in Q_2,a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\delta_{\\times}((p,q),a)\\coloneqq(\\delta_1(p,a),\\delta_2(q,a)),\\qquad M_1\\otimes_B M_2\\coloneqq(Q_1\\times Q_2,\\Sigma,\\delta_{\\times},(q_1,q_2),B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\nB_{\\cap}\\coloneqq F_1\\times F_2,\\quad B_{\\cup}\\coloneqq(F_1\\times Q_2)\\cup(Q_1\\times F_2),\\quad B_{\\triangle}\\coloneqq(F_1\\times(Q_2\\setminus F_2))\\cup((Q_1\\setminus F_1)\\times F_2)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product}\\vdash\nM_1\\otimes_B M_2\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1804,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-product|DFA 的乘积与布尔接受条件]]"},{"id":"33c001ba790a35c7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-dfa-product]] 中 $M_1,M_2,B,\\delta_{\\times}$ 的同一实例；扩张转移与语言依该定义的 DFA 语义。"},{"id":"f5ad19f3a79bf5de","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 为同一字母表上的 DFA；令 $n=|Q|,m=|P|$。语言语义、泵引理和乘积见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]、[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]、[[73-df-dfa-product]]、[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]。"}],"outgoing":["3b7a967565c86f39"]}